     "title": "Recommended Amount of Sleep for a Healthy Adult, American Academy of Sleep Medicine e Sleep Research Society, 2015",
     "url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4434546/"
    }
   ],
   "status": "published",
   "date": "2026-09-29",
   "createdAt": "2026-09-29T12:54:00.000Z",
